Package: qaxs
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Maintainer: Harshal <you@example.com>
Description: QAX-Smart - offline natural-language to shell-command compiler
 Converts natural-language requests into a single validated shell command
 for QAX, Bash, or Zsh, using a fully local Qwen2.5-Coder model via
 llama.cpp. No network access required at runtime.
